---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import LeadPopup from "../components/LeadPopup.astro";
import BackToTop from "../components/BackToTop.astro";

const description =
  "EliteFitness Is the oldest bodybuilding community forums in the world, started in 1996 it has grow to over 400,000 members. With topics like Anabolic steroids,Sarms,prohormones,TRT, hormone replacement and bodybuilding.";
const bodyClass = "home blog header-image full-width-content magazine-home";
---
<BaseLayout title="EliteFitness.com Bodybuilding and Steroids Mega community" description={description} bodyClass={bodyClass}>
  <Header />
  <div class="site-container">
    <div class="background-couple"></div>
    <div class="site-inner bgPattern">
      <div class="content-sidebar-wrap">
        <main class="content">



<div class="breadcrumbnew_and_tiitle">
  <h1 class="entry-title">Disclosure Policy</h1>

  <div class="breadcrumbnew">
 <a  title="Go to Articles and Blog - EliteFitness.com." href="https://www.elitefitness.com/articles" class="home">Articles and Blog - EliteFitness.com</a> > 

    <span property="name" class="post post-page current-item">Disclosure Policy</span>
    <p><strong>October 27, 2026p</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mainadvertise wrapWhite mt40">
  <div class="advertiseContent">
    
	
	
	


  <h3>This Disclosure Policy is valid from 30 January 2013</h3>
  <p>
    Online since 1996, EliteFitness.com is a member and sponsor supported community website for athletes and
    bodybuilders.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our member and sponsor support makes it possible to maintain the quality experience that distinguishes
    EliteFitness.com from the other bodybuilding sites on the Net.
  </p>
  <p>
    When you support EliteFitness.com by upgrading your membership or investing in a sponsorship, your dollars support
    the forums you love and depend on. EliteFitness.com is the largest archive of bodybuilding and anabolic steroid
    knowledge that has ever existed in the entire world - and keeping it online is a huge cost.
  </p>
  <p>
    In exchange for their contribution, our Platinum Members get some cool feature that our regular members do not.
    Important features like a 5000 PM mailbox, live chat, the stealth site ExpertPCSupport.com, unrestricted search,
    your own discussion board, the private Platinum Boards, full size pics and galleries, no ads, bonus reports, and fun
    stuff like Karma dots and glowing stars.
  </p>
  <p>
    And in exchange for their investment, our sponsors may receive special influence on the topics or posts made on this
    site. That content, advertising space or posts may not always be identified as paid or sponsored content.
  </p>
  <p>
    EliteFitness.com may be compensated to provide opinion on products, services, websites and various other topics.
    But, even though EliteFitness.com may be compensated for our posts or advertisements, we always give our honest
    opinions, findings, beliefs, or experiences on those topics or products. Our views and opinions expressed here are
    purely our own. Any product claim, statistic, quote or other representation about a product or service should be
    verified with the manufacturer, provider or party in question.
  </p>
  <p>
    For questions about our Disclosure Policy or site in general, please use this email to gspellwin@elitefitness.com at
    any time.
  </p>
  <p>
    We appreciate the support of our members and sponsors. Your generosity makes it possible for us to remain online!
  </p>
  <iframe id="twitter-widget-0" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowtransparency="true" class="twitter-share-button twitter-share-button-rendered twitter-tweet-button" style="position: static; visibility: visible; width: 69px; height: 20px;" title="Twitter Tweet Button" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets/tweet_button.0568ee90c37ccf52b40a4b1e312811ff.en.html#dnt=false&amp;id=twitter-widget-0&amp;lang=en&amp;original_referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.elitefitness.com%2Farticles%2Fdisclosure-policy%2F&amp;size=m&amp;text=Disclosure%20Policy&amp;time=1793094005101&amp;type=share&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.elitefitness.com%2Farticles%2Fdisclosure-policy%2F" data-url="https://www.elitefitness.com/articles/disclosure-policy/"></iframe>

	
  </div>
</div>











